    {
      "id": "borgo-pass",
      "name": "The Borgo Pass",
      "description": "The mountains frown down on either side, dark firs stand against the late-lying snow, and the coach lamps throw a flickering ring on the white sandy road. Far off the wolves have begun to howl, and now and again a faint blue flame flickers among the rocks. The road back to Bistritz runs west; to the east a narrow way climbs through the pines towards the castle.",
