    {
      "id": "castle-courtyard",
      "name": "Courtyard of Castle Dracula",
      "description": "A vast ruined castle closes round a courtyard of considerable size, its tall black windows giving no ray of light and its broken battlements jagged against the moonlit sky. Great wooden boxes with handles of thick rope are heaped in one corner, and dark ways lead off under great round arches. The road down to the Borgo Pass is west; to the south a great door, old and studded with iron nails, opens into the castle.",
